look 1 ohm: current up (about EMF / 4, under 80 A), rotor rpm under 256 (record gap), clutch load toward 1 and redstoneOut up, stressSU stays 26624; redstone: clutch impact 0, stressSU 0, rotor rpm and commutator V fall; last reads: rotor within 5 % of 256, V back to the SQ-PWG-38B 256 RPM value

## SQ-PWG-41 | clutch motor mode on the -38 B line: 60 V on the commutator turns the rotor and a press; back to generator
> setblock 1100 -58 1180 minecraft:air
> zpwg3 place 1100 -58 1180 create:shaft axis=x
waitlog \[zpwg3\] done 20
> zpwg3 place 1099 -58 1180 create:mechanical_press facing=east
> zpwg4 clutch 1101 -58 1180 motor
> setblock 1110 -60 1180 minecraft:air
> zpwg3 src 1110 -60 1180 60
> zpwg3 w 1107 -60 1180 1 1110 -60 1180 0
> zpwg3 w 1110 -60 1180 1 1104 -58 1180 1
sleep 10
> zpwg4 kin 1101 -58 1180
> zpwg4 kin 1102 -58 1180
> zpwg4 kin 1104 -58 1180
> zpwg4 kin 1099 -58 1180
> zpwg3 be 1107 -60 1180
> zpwg4 clutch 1101 -58 1180 generator
sleep 5
> zpwg4 kin 1101 -58 1180
> zpwg4 kin 1099 -58 1180
> zpwg3 be 1099 -58 1180
> zpwg3 be 1100 -58 1180
expect \[zpwg4\] clutch motor$
expect \[zpwg4\] clutch generator$
expect \[zpwg3\] be Block\{create:mechanical_press\}
expect \[zpwg3\] be Block\{create:shaft\}
expect \[zpwg4\] .*generated=0 overstressed
reject \[zpwg\w*\] error
reject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(Exception|/ERROR\]).*(powergrid|patryk)
look motor mode: rotor rpm settles (about 87 at 1 A field; record), clutch generated = rotor RPM (integer) = press speed, capacitySU = 104 x RPM, stressSU = k x RPM, current gauge non-zero; generator mode: clutch generated=0, press speed 0

