> zpwg4 kin 1102 -57 1210
> zpwg4 kin 1102 -58 1210
> zpwg4 kin 1104 -58 1210
reject \[zpwg\w*\] error
reject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(Exception|/ERROR\]).*(powergrid|patryk)
look 256 RPM, swapped polarity: winding I and commutator V; exactly one of SQ-PWG-42 / -42s should build (I near 2 A, V near 250 V); record which

